{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21573","headline":"送友封二首 一 · 元稹","name":"送友封二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桃叶成阴燕引雏，南风吹浪颭樯乌。\n瘴云拂地黄梅雨，明月满帆青草湖。\n迢递旅魂归去远，颠狂酒兴病来孤。\n知君兄弟怜诗句，徧爲姑将恼大巫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21573.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21573","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}